<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">- Kuwidzihwa kwoBhaibhiri MuchiKorekore</book>
  <para style="h">VaRoma</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tsamba raPhauro kuvaRoma</para>
  <para style="toc2">VaRoma</para>
  <para style="toc3">VaRo</para>
  <para style="mt2">Tsamba Ridonyohwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">naPhauro</para>
  <para style="imt">KUWIDZIRA</para>
  <para style="io1">Bhuku ravaRoma rinogona kunge ridonyohwa noNhumwa Phauro panguwa iri pakati pomakore 54 na 58 musure mokuberekewa kwaKhirisitu. Phauro wanga asati wabvakachira Roma saka adotumira tsamba rakareri kuti araire maKhirisitu vomuRoma, vochiJudha novasiri maJudha. Adonyora tsamba iri ari muguta rovaKorinde maaigara panguwa iyoyo. Phauro adonyorera kuti marudzi yese yatende uye kuti yateerere Jesu Khirisitu VaRoma 16:26. Chikamu chokupedzisira chavaRoma zvitsauko (1-12) chino dzidziso youmwari idodzika uye chikamu chochipiri (13-15) chinorairo yozvokuita zvidowanda paupenyu hwochiKhirisitu.</para>
  <para style="io1">Bhuku ravaRoma ibhuku ridokoshera maKhirisitu kwese kwese nomunguwa dzese nondava yokujekesa nokupedzeredza kunoitiwa naPhauro pakutsanangura ruponiso ratinogona kuwana kuburikidza naJesu Khirisitu. Phauro anobatanidzawo vhangeri raJesu Khirisitu noChibvumirano Chokare. Ana mazvikokota vodzidzo vazinji vanobvumirana kuti (VaRoma 1:16) ndiyo ndima yobhuku rakareri iri pakatorotoro mubhuku rakareri. Inoti, “Handinyare kuparidza vhangeri, ndava isimba raMwari rokuponesa wese anotenda, kuthanga nomuJudha, tevere vodzimwe Ndudzi.”</para>
  <para style="iot">Marongehwo:</para>
  <para style="io1">Phauro anothanga tsamba yache nokuzvizivisa kuti iye mbani nokutaura kuti mbani waarikunyorera (VaRoma 1:1-15)</para>
  <para style="io1">Chochipiri anonyora mamiriro yanowanika pamunhu wese nokukwanisika kworuponiso kuburikidza naJesu Khirisitu (VaRoma 1:16—11:36)</para>
  <para style="io1">Pasure pozvakarezvo Phauro anopereka rairo yozvokuita zvidowanda zvinodiwa pakurarama kwochiKhirisitu (VaRoma 12:1—15:13)</para>
  <para style="io1">Anopedza tsamba ravaRoma nokumoresa vanhu vadosiyana siyana mukherekhe iri paRoma (VaRoma 16)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Phauro muranda waJesu Khirisitu, adodaidziwa kuti ave nhumwa, adokamurihwa vhangeri raMwari <verse eid="ROM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />raadogara wavimbisa kare kuburikidza novaporofiti vache muMagwaro Matsvene,<verse eid="ROM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />pamusoro poMwanakomana wache, anova mwana waDhavhiti panyama, <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />adozivisiwa nosimba kuburikidza noMweya woutsvene kuti ndiye Mwanakomana waMwari nokumuka kwaadoita kubva kuvadopfa, iye Jesu Khirisitu Ishe wedu. <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Kuburikidza naye tidotambira mutsa nounhumwa kuti tidaidze vanhu kubva pakati povese vasiri vaJudha kuti vauye pakuteerera kunobva pakutenda. <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Naimimiwo muri pakati paivo vadodaidziwa kuti vave vaJesu Khirisitu.<verse eid="ROM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Kunovese vari kuRoma vadodiwa naMwari vadodaidziwa kuti vave vatsvene.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 1:7">Mutsa norugare zvinobva kuna Mwari Baba vedu nokuna Ishe wedu Jesu Khirisitu mbazvive kwamuri.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munamato woKutenda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Kuthanga, ndinotenda Mwari wangu kuburikidza naJesu Khirisitu nondava yenyu mese, ndava kutenda kwenyu kuri kutauhwa munyika dzese. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Mwari wandinoshumira nomwoyo wangu wese pakuparidza vhangeri roMwanakomana wache, ndiye chapupu changu kuti ndinogara ndichikufungai <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />nguwa dzese muminamato yangu, futi ndinonamata kuti dai zvino kwava kuda kwaMwari kuti nzira indivhurikire ndibudirire kuuya kwamuri. <verse eid="ROM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Ndinosuva kukuonai kuitira kuti ndikupungurirei chimwe chipo chomweya chikusimbisei. <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />ndiko kuti, imipa nainini tikurudzirane pakutenda.<verse eid="ROM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Handidi kuti murekere kuziva, hama, kuti kazinji ndaironga kuuya kwamuri (asi ndaitadzisiwa kuzviita kusvikira zvino) kuitira kuti ndivewo nochokukohwa pakati penyu sezvandidoita pakati podzimwe Ndudzi. <verse eid="ROM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Ndiri musungwa kunovese vaGiriki novasiri vaGiriki, kuno vadochenjera novadozungaira. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Ndicho chikonzero ndichida kuparidza vhangeri kwamuriwo vari kuRoma.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Simba roVhangeri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Handinyare kuparidza vhangeri nokuti isimba raMwari rokuponesa anotenda: kuthanga nomuJudha tevere wodzimwe Ndudzi. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Ndava muvhangeri kururama kunobva kuna Mwari kudoisiwa pachenu, kururama kunouya nokutenda kubva pamavambo kusvika pamagumo, sekunyohwa kwazvidoitiwa, “Adorurama achararama nokuenda.”<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mhosva yoMunhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Ndava ukari hwaMwari hudonangidziwa kubva kudenga pamusoro pokurega kunamata Mwari kwese nokuipa kwovanhu vanotsikirira chokwadi nokuipa kwavo, <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />sezvo zvingade kuzikana pamusoro paMwari zviri pachenu kwavari, ndava Mwari adozvinangidza kwavari. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Ndava kubva pakusikiwa kwonyika umwari hwache husingaoneke, iro simba rokusingapere roumwari hwache, rinooneka zvidojeka, nokunzvitsitsika kubva pazvinhu zvaadoita, kuitira kuti vanhu vasaye chokunenera. <verse eid="ROM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />Ndava kana nepo vaiziva Mwari, havanai kumukudza saMwari kana kumbomutendawo nikisi, asi kufunga kwavo kudoita chidzimira nomwoyo yavo youdzemwa idoita rima. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Kana zvavo vaiti tidochenjera, vadova madzemwa <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />vadotsinhanisa kubhwinya kwaMwari asingapfe nozvifananidzo zvidoumbiwa kunge munhu kana tushiri nomhuka nozvinosvova.<verse eid="ROM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Saka Mwari adovasiya vari muzvido zvokutadza kwomwoyo yavo nokutsambwa dzoupombwe vachiita pakati pavo zvinozvidza miviri yavo. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />Vadotsinhanisa chokwadi chaMwari nomabwodo, ndokunamata nokushumira zvisikwa panzvimbo yoMusiki, anorumbidziwa nokusingapere Ameni.<verse eid="ROM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Nochikonzero chakarechi, Mwari adovasiya vari pakuchiva kunonyadzisa. Zvokuti novakadzi vavo vadotsinhanisa ukama hwochisikihwo vachitora hwavasinai kusikihwa. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Nonzira ibodzi bodziyo varume vadosiyawo ukama hudosikiwa kuti huve pakati pavo novakadzi ndokubva vapfiririra kudanana vega vega. Varume vachiita zvisinai mutsigo novarumebiyavo, muunhu hwavo vachitambira mubairo wouyanga hwavo.<verse eid="ROM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Pamusoro paizvozvo, sezvo vasinai kuona zvidokodzera kuti vachengetedze kuziva Mwari, saka Mwari adovareka vanopfungwa idofuririka inovakweerera kuita zvisingafanire kuitiwa. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Vadozaziwa nokuipa kwomarudzi yese, kunyangadza, nhafu noutadzi. Vadozara noruchiva, umhondi, mungu, unyengeri nokunyangarihwa. Vanomakuhwa, <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />vanofudza, vanozonda Mwari, vanomhanda, vanozvitutumadza vanomutindi, vanorukha nzira dzokuita nadzo zvidoipa, vasingateerere vabereki, <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />havafunge, havanai kutenda, havanai rudo, vanocheni. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Kana nepo vaiziva chirevo chaMwari chokururama chokuti avo vanoita zvinhu zvidodaro vanofanira ipfa, havasi kundoramba vachiita zvinhu zvakarezvo basi asi vanotobvumirana novanozviita vacho.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s1">Kutonga kwaMwari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />Saka haunai chokunenera, iwepa munhu unotonga umwe, ndava chese chaunotongera umwe uri kutozvitonga wega, ndava iwepa unoisa mutongo unoita zvibodzi bodzi. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Zvino tinoziva kuti mutongo waMwari pamusoro paivo vanoita zvinhu zvakarezvi uri pachokwadi. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Saka iwe munhu unotonga vanoita zvakarezvo asi iwepa uchiitawo zvibodzi bodzizvo, unofunga kuti unopunyuka mutongo waMwari nai? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Kana kutoti uri kutozvidza pfuma yokunaka kwache, nomwoyo murefu wache usingazive kuti kunaka kwaMwari kunokutungamirira pakupinduka? <verse eid="ROM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Asi nondava yomutindi wako nomwoyo wako usingapinduke, uri kuzvichengetera ukari pazuva roukari hwaMwari, pachanangidziwa kutonga kwache kwokururama. <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />Mwari achapasa munhu wese maererano nozvaadoita. <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Avo vano mwoyo murefu pakuita zvidonaka ndivo vanotsvaga kubhwinya, kuremekedzewa nokusapfa, ndivo vaachapasa upenyu husingapere. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Asi vaye vanozvitsvagira zvavo vachiramba chokwadi nokutevera zvidoipa, vachaitihwa ukari nohasha. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Pachava nonhamu nokushupika kumunhu wese anoita zvidoipa, kuthanga nomuJudha kwodzouyawo vodzimwe Ndudzi, <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />asi kubhwinya, kuremekedzewa norunyararo kumunhu wese anoita zvidonaka, kuthanga nomuJudha, tevere wodzimwe Ndudzi. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Ndava Mwari haanai tsvete.<verse eid="ROM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Vese vanotadza vasinai mutemo vachapararawo pasinai mutemo, novese vanotadza vari pasi pomutemo vachatongewa nomutemo. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Ndava havasi vaye vanonzva mutemo vadorurama pamberi Mwari, asi mbaye vanoteerera mutemo ndivo vachanzi vadorurama. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Ndizvo kuti vodzimwe Ndudzi, vasinai mutemo, kana muunhu hwavo vakaita zvinhu zvinodiwa nomutemo wava mutemo kwavari, kana nepo mutemo wacho vasinai, <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />sezvo vachinangidza kuti zvinodiwa nomutemo zvidonyohwa pamwoyo yavo, hana yavo ichivapupurira, nopfungwa dzavo dzichiti pamwe dzinovanenera mhosva pamwe dzinovareverera. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Zvakarezvi zvichaitika pazuva iro Mwari raachatonga zvidohwanzika zvovanhu kuburikidza naJesu Khirisitu, sezvinorehwa novhangeri rangu.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Zvino iwewe kana uchizvidaidza kuti muJudha, udotsamira pamutemo uchizvitutumadza nokuda kwoukama hwako naMwari, <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />uchiziva kuda kwache nokupatsanura zvidokodzera nondava yokuti udoraihwa nomutemo, <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />kana unochokwadi chokuti uri mutungamiri womarombe, nochiedza choavo vari murima, <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />murairiri womadzemwa, mudzidzisi wovana, ndava mumutemo muno zvese, ruzivo nochokwadi. <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />Zvino iwepa unodzidzisa vamwe, hauzvidzidzisewo nai? Iwepa unoparidza uchirambidza kuba, ndiwe womboba kamu? <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Iwepa unoti vanhu havafanire kuita upombwe, ndiwe wombopomba kamu? Iwepa unosema zvifananidzo, ndiwe kamu unoba zvomuimba yaMwari? <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Iwepa unozvitutumadza nokuda kwomutemo, ndiwe unozvidza Mwari nokuchora kwaunoita mutemo kamu? <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Sekunyohwa kwazvidoitiwa kuti, “Zita raMwari rinoshohwa pakati povasiri maJudha nondava yenyu.”<verse eid="ROM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Kuchecheudziwa kudokosha kana uchichengeta mutemo, asi kana uchichora mutemo, wandoita kunge usinai kuchecheudziwa. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Kana vasinai kuchecheudziwa vakachengeta zvinodiwa nomutemo, vangareke nai kutohwa kunge vaye vadochecheudziwa? <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Munhu asinai kuchecheudziwa panyama asi achiteerera mutemo achakupasa mhosva iwewe udochecheudziwa uye uno chinyohwa, asi uchichora mutemo. <verse eid="ROM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Munhu haasi muJudha kana uJudha hwache huri hwokunze basi, nokuchecheudziwa hakusi iko kana kuri kwonyama, kwokunze. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />MuJudha nguye ari muJudha mukati, nokuchecheudziwa nghuye kwomwoyo kunoitiwa pamweya aikona kwochaiko. Kurumbidziwa kwomunhu adodai kunobvaba kuvanhu asi kuna Mwari.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Saka chii chiyamuro chokuva muJudha? Kana iko kuchecheudziwako kudokoshei? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Zvidotowanditsa pazvese! Chokuthanga nyhokuti vaJudha vadovimbiwa navo kuti mbachengeti vomashoko yaMwari. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Ko kana pakati pavo varipo vasinai kutendeka? Kusaya kutendeka kwavo kungasaise basa kutendeka kwaMwari nai? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Mukho: Mwari ndiye mbaave chokwadi, munhu wese ave womabhwodo, Semanyorehwo yazvidoitiwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">“Kuti muve mudokohoroka mumashoko yenyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:4">Pakamu pese pamunenge motongewa, mukomwese.”<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Ko kana kudzonga kwedu kuchinyanya kuisa pachenu kukohoroka kwaMwari, tinopati chii ipopo? Mwari anenge watsveyamisa nai pakutiranga? Ikoku kundonyairawo semunhu. <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Mukho: anga zvikadaro nyika ingatongewe tini naMwari?<verse eid="ROM 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Umwe angati, “Manje kana chokwadi chokubhwinya kwaMwari chichiingidzihwa nomabhwodo yangu, indava yei ndichitongewa kuti ndiri mutadzi? <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Tinorekerei kuti, ‘Mbatiitei zvidoipa kuti zvidonaka zviuye,’ sezvinonyaihwa novashori? Kutongewa kwavo kudokodzera.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hapanai Adorurama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />Kuti chii? Isisu vaJudha tiri hasa pana ivo? Neye, kana nopadiki, ndava tanangidza kare kuti vaJudha novodzimwe Ndudzi, vese vari muzvitema, <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />Sekunyohwa kwazvidoitiwa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">“Hapanai adokohoroka kana nomubodzi,<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />Hapanai anonzvitsitsa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:11">hapanai anotsvaga Mwari.<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Vese vadotsambuka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">vese vandova chinhu chisinai nokabonyo kese,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">hapanai anoita zvidonaka, kana nomubodzi wese.<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />“Kagurokuro kavo iguwa ridoshama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">turimi tavo tunoshanda kunyengera,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">“Nduru yanyakungu iri pamiromo yavo.”<verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />“Mukamwa mavo mudozara kurengerera nokuchochora.”<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />“Tsoka dzavo dzinomhanyira kodurura gazi,<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />kuparadza nokubonera ndizvo zviri munzira yavo,<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />nonzira yorunyararo vanoizivaba.<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />“Kucha Mwari hakupo mumaziso mavo.”<verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Zvino tinoziva kuti chipi nochipi chinorehwa nomutemo chinoudziwa ivo vari pasi pomutemo, kuti miromo yese inyaradziwe, nonyika yese ive pasi pokutonga kwaMwari. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Ndava hapanai munhu achanzi adorurama pamberi paMwari zvichibva pakuchengeta mutemo, asi kutoti, kuburikidza nomutemo tinopinziwa pakuziva chitema.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kururamisiwa Nokutenda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Asi kururama kwaMwari kusingabve pamutemo kudozivisiwa, kuchipupurihwa nomutemo novaporofiti. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />Kururama uku kunobva kuna Mwari kunouya kuburikidza nokutenda muna Jesu Khirisitu kunovese vanotenda. Ndava hakusiyanisi, <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />Nokuti vese vadotadza vadoperevera kusvika pakubhwinya kwaMwari. <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Vanondoruramisiwa mahara nonyasha kuburikidza nokununura kuri muna Khirisitu Jesu. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Mwari adomupereka kuti nogazi rache ave chibairo chokuregerehwa kwozvitema kunotambihwa nokutenda. Adoita izvozvo kuti anangidze kururamisa kwache, ndava pamwoyo murefu woumwari hwache, adorekera kuranga zvitema zvidotadziwa kare. <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />Adozviitira kuti anangidze kururamisa kwache panguwa ino, uye kuti iye pachake adorurama futi ndiye mururamisi waivo vanotenda muna Jesu.<verse eid="ROM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Zvino kuzvikudza kwedu kuri poi? Kwabisiwa. Nokuda kwomurau upi? Wokuita mabasa yomutemo chere? Neye, asi wokutenda. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Ndava tinobatirira pakuti munhu anoruramisiwa nokutenda pasinai mabasa yomutemo. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Anga iye Mwariyo ngwovaJudha vega vega? Haasi Mwari wodzimwewo Ndudzi nai? Hinde, ndiMwari wodzimwewo Ndudzi kamu. <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />Sezvo kuchindova naMwari mubodzi, anoruramisa vadochecheudziwa novasinai, nokutenda kubodzi bodziko. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Anga zvino tinotaya mutemo nondava yokutendako? Nenene kana nopadiki! Asi kutoti tinosimbisa mutemo.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s1">Muenzaniso waAbhurahamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Zvino toti chiiko pamusoro paAbhurahamu teteguru vedu panyama? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Ndava dai Abhurahamu adoruramisiwa nomabasa, angadai ano chokuzvikudza nacho, manje pamberi paMwari, haanai. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />Ko Gwaro rinoti chii? “Abhurahamu adotenda Mwari ndokubva waverengehwa pakuva adorurama.” <verse eid="ROM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Zvino kumunhu anoshanda, muhoro wache haudaidziwe kuti chipo, asi unenge uri muripo wache. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Asi kumunhu asinai kushanda asi achindovimba naiye anoruramisa adoipa, kutenda kwacheko ndiko kunoverengewa kuti ndiko kururama. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Dhavhiti anorevawo zvibodzi bodzizvo paanonyaira zvokukomborehwa kwomunhu anoverengehwa pakururama naMwari, pasinai mabasa:<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />“Vadokomborehwa ivo vano zvitema zvidoregerehwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">nozvakaipa zvidofukidziwa,<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />adokomborehwa munhu uyo Mwari waasingadzoverengera zvitema zvache.”<verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Anga chikomborero ichochi nyhovadochecheudziwa vega vega nai kana kuti novasinai kuchecheudziwa nyhavowo? Tambonyaira tichiti kutenda kwaAbhurahamu ndiko kudomuita kuti averengehwe pakururama. <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Zvanga zvidomira tini paadoverengehwa pakururama? Wanga wabva kuchecheudziwa chere kana kuti wanga asati? Wanga asati, aikona wabva kuchecheudziwa. <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Futi adotodzotambira chiratidzo chokuchecheudziwa sechisimbiso chokururama kwaanga awana nokutenda asati wachecheudziwa. Chinangwa changa chiri chokumuita baba wovese vanotenda asi vasinai kuchecheudziwa kuitira kuti vaverengehwe pakururama. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Ari kamu baba wovadochecheudziwa, aikona vadochecheudziwa vega asiwo noavo vanotekaira mutsoka dzokutenda kwanga kuri muna baba vedu Abhurahamu asati wachecheudziwa.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Chivimbiso chaMwari Chinotambihwa Nokutenda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Chivimbiso kuna Abhurahamu nokuvana vache, chokuti vachagara nhaka yonyika, hachinai kuuya kuburikidza nomutemo, asi kuburikidza nokururama kwokutenda. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Kana vanorarama mumutemo vari ivo vaji vonhaka, kutenda kunenge kusisina kukosha, kana nochivimbiso hachichinawo basa. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Ndava mutemo unouyisa ukari, futi pasinai mutemo hapanai kuchora mutemo.<verse eid="ROM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Nokuti chivimbiso chidotsamira pakutenda kuitira kuti chive chomutsa kuti pavewo nochokwadi kuti chinosvika kuvana vache vese, aikona vaye vari mumutemo vega vega, asi novayewo vokutenda kwaAbhurahamu anova baba vedu tese. <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />Semanyorehwo yazvidoitiwa, “Ndakuita baba womarudzi mazinji.” Ndiye baba vedu pamberi paMwari, iye waadotenda kwaari, Mwari anopasa upenyu vadopfa, anodaidza zvinhu zvisipo kuti zvivepo. <verse eid="ROM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Panga pasingagurupirike, nokutenda Abhurahamu adogurupira, achibva wava baba vomarudzi mazinji, sekunyepewa kwaanga aitiwa kuti, “Ndizvo zvichaita vana vako.” <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />Haanai kuita makhato pakutenda nokuda kwomuiri wache wanga watopfa zvawene, ndava wanga watova nomakore zana, kana noungomwa hwaSara. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Haanai kugwetedzeka pakutenda achipokana chivimbiso chaMwari asi adojirichira pakutenda achipasa mbiri kuna Mwari. <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />Adozara nokugutsikana kuti Mwari chaadovimbisa anogonawo kuchiita. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Ndokusaka kutenda kwache kudoverengehwa pakururama. <verse eid="ROM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Mashoko yokuti “Kudoverengehwa kwaari,” yadonyorehwaba iye wega. <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />Asi nokwatiriwo kuchaverengehwawo daro kana tichitenda maari iye adomutsa Ishe wedu Jesu kubva kuvadopfa. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />Adoisiwa pakupfa nokuda kwozvitema zvedu, asi adomuka kamu noupenyu kuitira kururamisiwa kwedu.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s1">Kukohoroka Kuna Mwari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Sezvo tidoruramisiwa nokutenda, tino runyararo kuna Mwari kuburikidza naIshe wedu Jesu Khirisitu. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Kuburikidza naiye tidowana masvikiro yomunyasha dzakaredzi dzatidomira madziri. Pakare tinofara nokugurupira kukovehwa kubhwinya kwaMwari! <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Aikona zvakarezvo zvegazvega, asiwo tinotofara mumatambudziko yedu, ndava tinoziva kuti matambudziko yanozvara kutsungirira, <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />iko kutsungirira kunozvara unhu, unhu hunopasa kugurupira. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Iko kugurupira hakutinyadzise ndava Mwari adodurura rudo rache mumwoyo yedu kuburikidza noMweya Mutsvene waadotipasa.<verse eid="ROM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Munoona, panguwa idofanira, patanga tisinai simba, panguwa idofanira, Khirisitu adopfira vanyangadzi. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Ndava zvikukutu kuti munhu apfire munhu adorurama, kana nepo umwe angade zvache kupfira adorurama. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Asi Mwari anonangidza rudo rake kwatiri pakuti, patanga tichiri vatadzi Khirisitu adotipfira! <verse eid="ROM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Sezvo tidoruramisiwa nogazi rache, tichatokungudziratuba kuponesewa naye kubva paukari hwaMwari! <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Ndava kana pataiva mhandu dzaMwari, tidoyananisiwa naye kuburikidza noipfa yoMwanakomana wache, ko kudzoti tatoyananisiwa, tichakungudza zvidoita tini kuponesewa noupenyu hwache! <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Aikona zvakarezvo basi, asiwo tinofara muna Mwari kuburikidza naIshe wedu Jesu Khirisitu waadotipasa naye kuyananisiwa.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adhamu naKhirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Saka semapindiro yadoita chitema munyika kuburikidza nomunhu mubodzi, ipfa ichibva yapindawo pabodzi nochitemacho, nonzira yakareyo ipfa idouyawo kuvanhu vese, ndava vese vadotadza. <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Mutemo usati wapasiwa, chitema changa chichitova munyika. Asi kana pasinai mutemo, chitema chinoverengewaba. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Zvisinei, ipfa idotonga kubva panguwa yaAdhamu kusvika panguwa yaMozisi, ichitobatawo novanhu vasinai kuchora mutemo kunge zvidoitiwa naAdhamu, uyo wanga ari muenzaniso waiye wadzouya. <verse eid="ROM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Manje chipo chomahara hachinai kuenzana nokutadza. Ndava kana vazinji vadopfa nondava yokutadza kwomubodzi, kudzoti mutsa dzaMwari nochipo chomahara chomutsa chidouya nomubodzi iye Jesu Khirisitu, chidonyanyitsirafuti peno kubata vadowanda. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Pakamu chipo chaMwari chinofananaba nozvidoitika pakutadza kwomunhu: Mutongo udotevera chitema chibodzi chichibva chauyisa kutongewa, asi chipo chomahara chidotevera zvitema zvizinji chichibva chauyisa kururamisiwa. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Ndava kana nokutadza kwomubodzi, ipfa idotonga kuburikidza nomubodziyo, zvichanyanyitsa tini kuti ivo vanotambira chipo chokururamisiwa nonyasha dzidowanda vatonge muupenyu kuburikidza nomubodzi iye Jesu Khirisitu.<verse eid="ROM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Mapasihwo yadoitiwa vazinji mhosva nokutadza kwomubodzi ndomwenze kururama kudoitiwa nomubodzi kudopasa kusununguriwa kwovanhu vese. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Ndava sezvidoitika kuti kuburikidza nokusateerera kwomunhu mubodzi, vazinji vadoitiwa vatadzi, ndozvazvidoitawo kuti kuburikidza nokuteerera kwomunhu mubodzi, vazinji vachaitiwawo vadorurama. <verse eid="ROM 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Mutemo udotodzopindawo kuti kutadza kuwanzikidziwe. Asi padowanda chitema, mutsa dzidosokokerafuti kuwanda, <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />kuitira kuti, sekutonga kudoita chitema chiri muipfa, mutsa dzitongewo daro kuburikidza nokururama kunouyisa upenyu husingapere huri muna Jesu Khirisitu Ishe wedu.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s1">Kupfa Pachitema Uchiva Mupenyu muna Khirisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Manje toti chii? Timbondotadza kuitira kuti mutsa dzimbondowanziwa chere? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Neye, mukho! Anga isisu tidopfa kuchitema tinodzorarama tini kamu tiri machiri? <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Munozivaba nai kuti isisu tese tidoombekewa muna Khirisitu Jesu tidoombekewa muipfa yache? <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />Nokudaro tidovigiwa naye muruombeko roipfa yache kuti sezvidondoita Khirisitu kumutsiwa kuvadopfa kuburikidza nokubhwinya kwaBaba, naisisuwo tirarame muupenyu hutsva.<verse eid="ROM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Kana tidobatana naye muipfa yache daipa, tichabatanawo naye mukumuka kunge zvaadoita. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Ndava tinoziva kuti unhu hwedu hwokare hudorovehwa pabodzi naye kuitira kuti muviri wozvitema uparadziwe, kuti tireke kudzova varanda vochitadzo, <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />ndava wese wapfa wasununguriwa kubva pachitema. <verse eid="ROM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Manje kana tidopfa naKhirisitu, tinotenda kuti tichararamawo naye. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Ndava tinoziva kuti sekumutsiwa kudoita Khirisitu kubva kuvadopfa, achapfaba kamu, ipfa haichinai masimba pamusoro pache. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Ipfa yaadopfa mairi, adopfa kabodzi kuchitadzo zvichibva zvapera, asi upenyu hwaanorarama anorarama kuna Mwari. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Nonzira ibodzi bodziyo mbozvitorai muri vadopfa kuchitema, asi muri vapenyu kuna Mwari muna Khirisitu Jesu.<verse eid="ROM 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Saka mborekai kurekerera chitema chichitonga mumuviri yenyu inopfa, kuti mutevere kuda kwachene. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Rekai kumbopereka nhengo dzomuviri wenyu kuchitema kuti imbova midziyo yokuitisa zvidoipa, asi riperekei kuna Mwari, sevanhu vadobiritsiwa paipfa vachiisiwa muupenyu, mboperekai nhengo dzomiviri yenyu kuna Mwari kuti ive midziyo yokururama. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Ndava chitema chingaveba tenzi wenyu, nokuti hamusi pasi pomutemo asi ponyasha.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Varanda Vokururama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Kuti chii? Totadza zvedu nondava yokuti hatisi pasi pomutemo asi pasi ponyasha? Mukho wakareyo! <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Munozivaba nai kuti kana mazvipereka kunoumwe munhu kuti mumbomuteerera sevaranda, matova varanda vaiye wamunoteererayo, kabanga kuva varanda vochitadzo chinokuisai paipfa, kana kuva varanda vokuteerera kunokuisai pakururama? <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Asi Mwari mbaatendewe ndava kana zvenyu maimbova varanda vochitadzo, mudodzoteerera nomwoyo wese rudzi rodzidziso yamudovimbiwa nayo pakuipasiwa. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Mudosununguriwa kubva pachitema muchiva varanda vokururama. <verse eid="ROM 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Zvakarezvo ndiri kuzvinyaira mumashoko yadopepuka nondava yokusaya simba kwenyu. Sezvamaiita pakupereka nhengo dzomiviri yenyu kuva varanda votsambwa nouipi hunogara huchiingidzika, nonzira yakareyo perekai nhengo dzenyu kukururama kunoisa kuutsvene.<verse eid="ROM 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Pamaiva varanda vochitadzo manga mudosununguhwa pasimba rokururama. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Panguwa iyoiye chii chamaiwana pazvinhu zvakarezvo zvamanga muchiita, zvamava kutonyara nazvo manje? Chaibuda pazvinhu zvakarezvo ipfa. <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Asi manje mudosununguhwa kubva pachitema muchiva varanda vaMwari, chamunowana apa utsvene nochinobuda pakarepo upenyu husingapere. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Ndava mubairo wochitema ipfa, asi chipo chaMwari, upenyu husingapere muna Khirisitu Jesu Ishe wedu.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s1">Muenzaniso woKuroorana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Naimi hama dzangu anga munozivaba nai, ndava ndiri kunyaira kuvanhu vanoziva mutemo, kuti mutemo unondova nosimba kana munhu achiri mupenyu basi? <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Semuenzaniso, pamutemo mukadzi adoroorewa adosungiwa kumurume wache kana murumeyo achiri mupenyu, asi kana murume wache wapfa, wasuguduriwa pamutemo wouroodzi. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Zvokuti akaroorewa noumwe murume iye murume wache achiri mupenyu, anonzi ihure. Asi kana murume wache wapfa, wasuguduriwa pamutemo, kana zvache akaroorewa nomumwe, anenge asiri hure. <verse eid="ROM 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Saka hama dzangu, kuburikidza nomuviri waKhirisitu imipa mudopfa kumutemo kuti muve voumwe murume, kureva iye adomuka kuvadopfa, kuti tiitire Mwari zvibereko. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Ndava pataitongewa nounhu hwakare kadokwadokwa kokuda kutadza kaimutsiwa nomutemo mumiviri yedu kuti tibereke zvibereko zvoipfa. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Asi zvino nokupfa kwatidoita kunochiye changa chidotisunga, tidosununguhwa kubva pamutemo, kuitira kuti tishumire nonzira itsva yoMweya, aikona nonzira yokare yomutemo udonyohwa.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mutemo noChitadzo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />Toti chii manje? Mutemo chitadzo nai? Neye, ndava hapanai peno maziviro yandaidzoita kuti ichi chitadzo dai pasinai mutemo udondiudza. Ndaidzozivaba kuti kuchiva huita tini dai mutemo usinai kuti “Reka kuchiva.” <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Manje chitema chidowana mukana wachidozururihwa nomutemo, chichibva chaisa mandiri marudzi yese yokuchiva. Ndava pasinai mutemo chitema chinenge chidopfa. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Mutemo usati wauya, ndanga ndiri mupenyu, mutemo paudouya chitema ndicho chidodzova chipenyu, inini ndokubva ndapfa. <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />Ndidodzoona kuti mutemo wacho wanga udonanga kundipasa upenyu udotondivigira ipfa. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Ndava chitema pachidotora mukana wachidopasiwa nomutemo, chidondinyengedza zvokubva chandibaya kuburikidza nomutemo wakareyo. <verse eid="ROM 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Nokudaro mutemo mutsvene, nomurairo mutsvene, futi udonaka. <verse eid="ROM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Anga manje chidonakacho chidodzova ipfa kamu kwandiri? Nenene. Asi kuti chitema chizikane, chidopinza ipfa kwandiri kuburikidza nochidonakacho, kuitira kuti kuburikidza nomutemo, chitema chionekerefuti kunyangara kwachene.<verse eid="ROM 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hondo Iri Matiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Tinoziva kuti mutemo ngwomweya; inini ndiri wonyama, ndidotengesewa semuranda kuchitema. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />Ndinonzvitsitsaba zvandinoita. Ndava zvandinoda kuita ndizvoba zvandinodzoita, asi zvandinozonda zviye, zvakarezvo ndizvo zvandinoita. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Manje kana ndichiita zvandisingade kuita, ndinobvuma kuti mutemo udonaka. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Saka ndiniba peno ndiri kuzviita, chitema chinogara mandiricho ndicho chiri kuzviita. <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Ndinoziva kuti hapanai chidonaka chinogara mandiri, kureva muunhu hwangu hwakare. Ndava ndino chido chokuita zvidonaka, asi kudzoti ndizviite gogogo. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Ndava zvandinoita ndizvoba zvidonaka zvandinoda kuita, nikisi, asi zvidoipa zvandisingade kuitazvo ndizvo zvandinosimbira kuita. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Manje kana ndichiita zvandisingade kuita, ndiniba ndipo ndichiri kuzviita, chitema chinogara mandiri ndicho chiri kuzviita.<verse eid="ROM 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Saka murau wandiri kuona uchishanda nguyu: Pandinoda kuita zvidonaka, chidoipa ndicho chinenge chiripo pakarepo. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Ndava mumunhu wangu womukati ndinofarira murau waMwari. <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />Asi mumuviri wangu ndinoona umwe murau udosiyana uchihwisana nopfungwa dzangu, uchinditapa nokundiita muranda womurau wochitema chinoshanda mumuviri wangu. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />O, munhuni ndiri kuyaura uyanga! Mbani achandisunungura kubva kumuviri woipfayu? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Mwari mbaatendewe, kuburikidza naJesu Khirisitu Ishe wedu!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Zvidodaipo, inini pachangu: mupfungwa mangu, ndiri muranda womutemo waMwari, asi muunhu hwangu hwakare ndiri muranda wochitema.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s1">Upenyu huri muMweya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Saka hapachinai kupasiwa murandu kuna ivo vari muna Khirisitu Jesu. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Ndava kuburikidza naKhirisitu Jesu, mutemo woMweya woupenyu udondisunungura kubva kumutemo wochitema nowoipfa. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Ndava mutemo zvawanga usingakwanise kuita nochikonzero chokuvhuwisiwa nonyama, Mwari adozviita kuburikidza nokutuma kwaadoita Mwanakomana wache ari muchimiro chomutadzi, kuitira chitema, achibva wapasa mhosva chitema chiri munyama, <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />kuitira kuti kururama kunodiwa nomutemo kuzazisike mukati medu iyesu tisingararame tichitongewa nounhu hwakare, asi tichitongewa noMweya. <verse eid="ROM 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Ndava vaye vanorarama vari muunhu hwakare, pfungwa dzavo dzidobatirira pazvido zvonyama, asi vaye vanorarama muMweya, pfungwa dzavo dzidobatirira pazvido zvoMweya. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Kufunga kwounhu hwakare, ipfa, asi kufunga kunotongewa noMweya, upenyu norunyararo, <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />ndava pfungwa younhu hwakare idopanduka kuna Mwari, inozviisaba pasi pomutemo waMwari, kana nokuedzeserako inokonaba. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Saka vaye vanotongewa nonyama vanokwanisaba kufadza Mwari.<verse eid="ROM 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Asi imipa hamutongewe nonyama, asi noMweya, ndokunge Mweya waMwari uchigara mamuri. Ndava kana munhu asinai Mweya waKhirisitu ngwacheba. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Asi kana Khirisitu ari mamuri, muviri wenyu udopfa nondava yochitema, asi mweya wenyu mupenyu nondava yokururama. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Futi kana Mweya waiyeyo adomutsa Jesu kubva kuvadopfa achigara mukati menyu, wakareyo nyakumutsa Jesu kuvadopfa achapasawo upenyu miviri yenyu inopfa kuburikidza noMweya wache anogara mamuri.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Nokudaro hama dzangu hatinai chikwerete nonyama kuti timboita zvainoda, <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />ndava kana pakurarama kwenyu muchimbotevera nyama muchapfa, asi kuburikidza noMweya mukambobaya zviito zvonyama, muchararama. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Ndava vaye vanotungamihwa noMweya waMwari, ndivo vana vaMwari vakarevo. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Ndava mudopasiwaba mweya wokuva varanda kuti mugare muchicha, asi mudotambira Mweya woumwana watinodaidza nawo tichiti, “Baba, Baba!” <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Mweya pachake anopfakaza kumweya yedu kuti tiri vana vaMwari. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Manje kana tiri vana, tiri vaji vonhaka, vaji vonhaka yaMwari pabodzi naKhirisitu, kana tichikovana naye matambudziko, tichakovanawo naye kamu kubhwinya kwache.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kubhwinya Kwonguwa Inouya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Ndinoti kutambudzika kwedu kwamanji kunokodzeraba kuenzanisiwa nokubhwinya kuchanangidziwa kwatiri. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Nokuti chisikwa chese chidotomirira notarisiro yokuratidziwa kwovana vaMwari. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />Ndava chisikwa chidondoisiwa pakuyaura icho chisingade, asi nokuda kwaiye adochiisa pakarepo notariro, <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />ndava icho chisikwa pachacho chichasununguriwa kubva pausungwa hwachene hwokuora chichiisiwa murusununguko rokubhwinya kwovana vaMwari. <verse eid="ROM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Tinoziva kuti kusvikira zvino, chisikwa chese chiri kumimira nokudzimbiwa kunenge mukadzi ari kupona. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Nyhisikwaba basi, asi kana naiyesu tinozvibereko zvokuthanga zvoMweya, tiri kumimirawo kamu tidomirira kutohwa kwedu tichiitiwa vana, ndiko kusununguriwa kwomiviri yedu. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Ndava tidoponesehwa tariro yakareyo. Asi tariro inooneka itariroba yochaiyo peno. Ndava mbani angagurupire chaari kutoona kare? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Asi kana tichigurupira chatisinai, tinomirira nomwoyo murefu.<verse eid="ROM 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Nonzira ibodzi bodziyo Mweya anobatsira kusaya simba kwedu ndava tinozivaba manamatiro yatinofanira kumboita, asi Mweya pachake anotinamatira nokugomera kusingataurike nomashoko. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Pakare iye anonzvera mwoyo yedu anoziva kufunga kwoMweya, ndava Mweya anonamatira vatsvene nonzira inodiwa naMwari.<verse eid="ROM 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Pakare tinoziva kuti Mwari anoshanda muzvinhu zvese kuti zviitire zvidonaka vanomuda, vaadodaidza maererano nochinangwa chache. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Ndava avo Mwari vaadoziva kare ndivo vaadotemera kare kuti vafanane noMwanakomana wache, kuitira kuti Mwanakomana ave dangwe kuvana vamwe vese. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Ivovo vaadotemera ndivo kamu vaadodaidza, vaadodaidzavo ndivo kamu vaadoruramisa, vaadoruramisa ndivo kamu vaadokovera kubhwinya kwache.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Rudo raMwari muna Khirisitu Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Toti chii manje pazvakarezvi? Kana Mwari ari wedu mbani anotihwisa? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Iye asinai kana kurambira Mwanakomana wache, asi adomupereka nokuda kwedu tese, angareke tini kutipasawo zvinhu zvese pabodzi naye? <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Mbani achanenera mhosva vasaruhwa vaMwari? Mwariyo ndiye anovaruramisa. <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Mbani anotongesa? ndiKhirisitu Jesu uyo adopfa chere, inde, iyeyo adomutsiwa kuvadopfa, ari kujanja roruji raMwari, iye ari kutinamatira! <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Mbani achatiparadzanisa norudo raKhirisitu? Ingave nhamu kana kuomehwa, kutambudziwa kana nzara, tsiku kana njodzi, kana hondo? <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Sekunyohwa kwazvidoitiwa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">“Nondava yenyu tinotarisana noipfa zuva rese,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 8:36">tinoitiwa kunge hwai dziri kuenda kobaiwa.”<verse eid="ROM 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Neye, pazvinhu zvakarezvi zvese tiri vakundi zvidopindiridza kuburikidza naiye adotida. <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Ndava ndinochokwadi kuti ingave ipfa kana upenyu, dzingave ngirozi kana vatongi, zvingave zvamanji kana zvinouya, kana masimba yapi zvayene, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />kana zvidokwirira kana zvokugwiri, kana chimwewo chinhu pazvisikwa zvese, hapanai chinogona kutiparadzanisa norudo raMwari ruri muna Khirisitu Jesu Ishe wedu.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s1">Mwari noVanhu Vache</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Ndinonyaira chokwadi muna Khirisitu, ndinobhwodokaba, nohana yangu inondipupurira muMweya Mutsvene, <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />ndinokusuwa kukurufuti uye kunetseka mumwoyo mangu hakupere. <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />Ndava ndingatoda zvangu kuti inipanoni ndive adoshurikidziwa uye kuti ndibisiwe pana Khirisitu nokuda kwohama dzangu panyama. <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />Ivo vaIzirairi vaadoita vana vache, kuvapinza muzvitenderano, achivanangidza kubhwinya kwache, nokuvapasa mutemo, ndivo vanonamata muimba yaMwari, pakare zvivimbiso zvaMwari ndivo vadozvipasiwa, <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />ndivo nzvahwa dzomadziteteguru yochiHebheru yanozikana, uye panyama Khirisitu adobva mavari, anova ndiye Mwari ari pamusoro pozvese, anokudziwe nokusingapere! Ameni.<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Izvi zvinorevaba kuti shoko raMwari ridokundikana. Ndava havasi vese vadozvahwa naIzirairi vari maIzirairi. <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />Kana vadozvahwa naAbhurahamu, mbanaba vache vese, asi “Vana vako vachaverengewa pana Isaki.” <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Nokumwe kutaura, mbanaba vopanyama vanova vana vaMwari, asi vana vochivimbiso ndivo vanotohwa sevana vaAbhurahamu. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Ndava aya ndomataurihwo yoshoko rochivimbiso, “Panguwa idotahwa ndichadzoka, Ipopo Sara achava nomwana womukomana.” <verse eid="ROM 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Ndizvoba zvega, asi novana vaRabheka kana zvache adoita vana nomurume mubodzi, ivo baba vedu Isaki, <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11" />mamhasa yasati yazvahwa futi vasati vaita chinhu chidonaka kana chidonyangara kuitira kuti chinangwa chaMwari chokusarura chimire, <verse eid="ROM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12" />aikona nomabasa asi naiye anodaidza, amai vavo vadoudziwa kuti, “Mukuru achashandira mudiki.” <verse eid="ROM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />Semanyorehwo yazvidoitiwa, “Jakobho ndidomuda, asi Isau ndidomuzonda.”<verse eid="ROM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Ipopo tinoti chii napo? Ko Mwari anoenzanisaba nai? Neye, ndizvo rini! <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Ndava kuna Mozisi anoti, “Ndichanzvira mutsa wandinenge ndanzvira mutsa, ndichaitira ngoni wandinenge ndanzvira ngoni.” <verse eid="ROM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Saka hazvinei nozvinodiwa nomunhu kana novavariro yache asi pamutsa waMwari. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Ndava pamusoro paFarao, Gwaro rinoti, “Ndidokugadza nochinangwa chakarechi, kuti mauri masimba yangu yaisiwe pachenu, nombiri yangu irehwe pasi pese.” <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Saka Mwari anoitira mutsa munhu waada kuitira mutsa, achipasa kuoma mwoyo waada kuti awome mwoyo.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukari noTsitsi dzaMwari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Umwe angati kwandiri, “Manje indava yei achidzoona mhosva? Pano anodzivisa zvaanoda chere?” <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Asi iwepa munhu ndiwe yani kuti uite mhoka naMwari daipo? Anga chiumbwa chingati kumuumbi wachene, “Udondiumbirei daipano?” <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Ko Muumbi wohari haanai nai kodzero yokuumba noivhu ribodzi bodziro mudziyo unokudziwa nousingakudziwe?<verse eid="ROM 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Ko kana Mwari, adoda kunangidza ukari hwache nokuita kuti masimba yache yazikane, nokunyanya kuitira mwoyo murefu midziyo yaadomwamwira yacho iyo idoitihwa kuparadziwa. <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />Kuitira kuti azivise pfuma yokubhwinya kwache kumidziyo yaadoitira mutsa, yaadogara wanhadzirira kare kubhwinya, <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />iyesu vaadodaidza, aikona kubva kuvaJudha basi asiwo kubva kuno vodzimwe Ndudzi? <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Iyoyo ndomwenze manyairiro yanoitiwa naHosiya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">“Ivo vaye vanga vasiri vanhu vangu ndichavadaidza kuti ‘mbanhu vangu,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">naiye wanga asiri mudikani wangu ndichamuti ‘mudikani.’”<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />“Pakare zvichaitika kuti panzvimbo yakareyo pavaiitiwa, ‘Ndimiba vanhu vangu,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">vachadaidziwa kuti mbanakomana vaMwari mupenyu.”<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Pamusoro paIzirairi Isaya adosheedzera achiti: Kana nepo kuwanda kwaIzirairi kuchiita kunge jecha romunyasi mogungwa, vadosara basi ndivo vachaponesewa. <verse eid="ROM 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />Ndava Ishe vachaita nokamangu zvavadoreva panyika nokuzvigumisa zvidozara.” <verse eid="ROM 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Isaya adogara wanyaira zvibodzi bodzizvo paadoti, “Dai Mwari asinai kutisiira dzimwe nzvahwa, dai tidoita kunge Sodhoma, futi dai tidofanana noGomora.”<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">vaIzirairi noVhangeri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Toti chii manje? Kuti vodzimwe Ndudzi vasinai kana nopavadotsvaga kururama, ndivo vadodzokutambira iko kururama kunouya nokutenda, <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />asi vaIzirairi vadotevera kururama kunouya nomutemo ndivo vadokusaya. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Sei? Ndava mutemoyo vadouteveraba nokutenda, asi vadouita kunge womabasa. Vadobva vaguhuniwa “noribhwe rinoguhuna.” <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />Semanyorehwo yazvidoitiwa kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">“Nangara, ndiri kuisa muZioni ribwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">richaita kuti vanhu vaguhuniwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">dombo richavambwedza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">Nouyo anotenda maari haanyadzisiwe.”<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Hama dzangu muditsitsiro wandinoita vanhu vokwangu ivo vaIzirairi kuti vaponesewe, ndinotovanamatira kuna Mwari. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Ndava ndinovapfakazira kuti vanoshungu dzokushandira Mwari, asi shungu dzavo hadzibve paruzivo. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Nondava yokusaziva kururama kwaMwari, vadobva vazvitsvagira kururama kwavo, ndokutadza kuzviisa pasi pokururama kwaMwari. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Ndava Khirisitu ndiye kugon’a kwomutemo kuitira kuti pave nokururamisiwa kwovese vanotenda.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ruponiso ndoVanhu Vese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Mozisi adonyora zvonzira yokururamisiwa kunoitiwa nomutemo, “Munhu anoita zvinhu zvakarezvi achararama nazvo.” <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Asi kururama kudotsamira pakutenda kunoti, Reka kumboti mumwoyo mako, “Mbani achakwira kudzuru?” (Ndiko kuti atiburutsire Khirisitu). <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />Kana kuti, “Mbani achaburukira kugwiri?” (Ndiko kuti atibiritsire Khirisitu kubva kuvadopfa). <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Asi kunoti chii? Shoko riri papfupi naiwewe, riri pamuromo pakopo nomumwoyo mako (ndiro shoko rokutenda ratinoparidza). <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Nokuti kana uchipupura nomuromo wako kuti Jesu ndiye Ishe pakare uchitenda mumwoyo mako kuti Mwari adomumutsa kubva kuvadopfa, uchaponesewa. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Ndava unotenda nomwoyo ndokuti ururamisiwe, pakare unopupura nomuromo wako woponesewa. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Rugwaro rinoti, “Hapanai anotenda maari anodzonyadzisiwa.” <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Ndava hapanai musiyano pakati pomuJudha nowodzimwe Ndudzi, Ishe mubodziyo ndiye Ishe wavo vese, anopasa pfuma yache vese vanodaidza kwaari. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />Ndava, “wese anodaidza zita raIshe anochidziwa.”<verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Anga zvino vanodaidza tini kuna iye wavasinai kutenda kwaari? Pakare vangatende tini muna iye wavasinai kunzva? Ko iko kunzvako vanonzva tini pasinai wavaparidzira? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Anga vangaparidze tini pasinai wavatuma? Sekunyohwa kwazvidoitiwa, “Manakiroba peno yadzene tsoka dzinouya nonyaya dzidonaka!” <verse eid="ROM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Manje havazi vese peno vadotambira nyaya dzidonaka. Ndava Isaya anoti, “Ishe mbani adotenda zvaadonzva kwatiri?” <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Sezvo kutenda kuchiuya nokunzva, nokunzva kunouya nokuparidziwa kwaKhirisitu.<verse eid="ROM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Manje ndinobvunza: Vadonzvaba chere? Vadonzva, hinde:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">“Mazvi yavo yadosvika pasi pese,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:18">Nomashoko yavo yadonzvika kumugumo wonyika.”<verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Ndinobvunza kamu: Ko vaIzirairi vadonzvitsitsaba? Kuthanga Mozisi anoti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">“Ndichakunzvisai chanje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">novasiri rudzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">Ndichakunzvisai ukari</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">norudzi rusinganzvitsitse.”<verse eid="ROM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Pakare Isaya anoshinga kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">“Ndidowaniwa novasinai kunditsvaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:20">Ndidozvinangidza kuno vanga vasingandibvunze.”<verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Asi pamusoro povaIzirairi anoti, “Ndidosvera zuva rese ndidotambanudza manja yangu kuvanhu vasingateerere novanopikisa.”<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s1">Varipo Vachasara kuvaIzirairi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />Inipano ndinobvunza kuti: Anga Mwari adoramba vanhu vache chere? Neye, ndizvo rini! Inini pachangu ndidotovawo muIzirairi, chizvahwa chaAbhurahamu, ndiri wodzinza raBhenjamini. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Mwari haanai kuramba vanhu vache, vaadogara waziva kare. Munozivaba nai zvinorehwa noGwaro pamusoro paEriya, kumhangarira kwaadoitira vaIzirairi kuna Mwari? <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />“Ishe, vadobaya vaporofiti venyu, vachipaza atari dzenyu, inini ndega ndegani ndini ndasara, kudaiku vari kutotsvaga kundibayawo.” <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Adomupindura kuti chii? “Ndidozvichengetera vanozvuru zvinomwe, vasinai kana kumbopfugamira Bhaari.” <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Saka nopanguwawo yakareino, varipo vadosara, vadosaruriwa nonyasha. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Manje dzikava mutsa, zvichavaba zvomabasa, ndava zvikava zvomabasa, kana nonyasha dzinenge dzichiriba mutsa. <verse eid="ROM 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Kuti chii? Chidotsvagitsitsiwa novaIzirairi havanai kuchiwana, vasaruhwa ndivo vadochiwana, vamwe vese vadoomesewa mwoyo, <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />sekunyohwa kwazvidoitiwa, “Mwari adovapasa mweya wokuzungaira, meso yano buzvi, nonzeve dzisinganzve kusvika pazuva ranasi.” <verse eid="ROM 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />NaDhavhiti anoti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">“Tafura yavo mbaive riva noukhonje hudoteyewa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">mbavatsiviwe nokuguhuniwa kuti vawe.<verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Meso yavo mbayaite rima kuti vatadze kuona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:10">misana yavo mbaigare idotumbamisiwa nokusingapere.<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Ndinobvunza kamu: Vadoguhuniwa kuti vawe? Ndizvo rini! Asi, nondava yokutadza kwavo, ruponiso rudouya kudzimwe Ndudzi kuti vaIzirairi vaite chanje. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Manje kana kutadza kwavo iri pfuma kunyika, nokurasikihwa kwavo iri noto kuno vodzimwe Ndudzi, ko kudzoti panokwanisiwa uwandu hwavo, makomborero yacho yanenge yadoita mukuriro wei!<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuponesewa Kwoyamwe Marudzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Ndiri kunyairira vakaremi vodzimwe Ndudzi. Zvandiri nhumwa wodzimwe Ndudzi, ndiri kukwidziridza basa rangu, <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />Ndichigurupira kuti kabanga ndingapase chanje kuvanhu vorudzi hwangu kuti vamwe vacho vaponesewe. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Saka kana kurambiwa kwavo kudoita kuti nyika iyananisiwe, ko kudzoti kutambihwa kwavo kunotorevaba upenyu kuno vadopfa?<verse eid="ROM 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Kana chikamu chidiki chomukanyiwa unoitiwa chipo chochibereko chokuthanga chiri chitsvene, saka mukanyiwa wese unenge wasara mutsvenewo peno, kana mudzi uri mutsvene nomathai yacho matsvene kamu. <verse eid="ROM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Kana yamwe mathai yomuorivhi yadokhwanhuriwa, asi iwepa, kana zvazvene uri bukira rothai romuorivhi, udophatikihwa pakati pomathai yomuorivhi womumusha, ndokuwanawo chikafu pamidzi yomuorivhi wakareyo. <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />Reka kumbodadira mathai yopakarepo yokukwanhuriwa yaye. Kana ukada zvokudada, fungitsitsa kuti, ndiweba udotakura midzi, asi midzi ndiyo idokutakura.<verse eid="ROM 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Ungati zvako, “Mathaiyo yadokwanhurihwa kuti inini ndiphachikihwe pakarepo.” <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Hinde. Vadokwanhuriwa nondava yokusatenda, iwepa udotomirawo nokutenda. Chireka kumbodumba, asi icha. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Ndava kana Mwari asinai kumisa mathai chaiyo yopakarepo, kana wakarewe anokumisaba. <verse eid="ROM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Pakarepa tinoona kunaka nokuoma kwaMwari: adooma kunovaye vadowa, asi adonaka kwamuri, ndokunge maramba muri mukunaka kwache. Potse potse naimimiwo munokhwanhuriwa kamu. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Kana vaJudha vakasiya kusatenda kwavo, vanophachikihwa kamu, ndava Mwari anogona kuvaphachikira pakare. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Kana imipa muri mathai yadotemewa pamuorivhi womusango muchibva maphachikihwa zviri kunze kwomutemo womusikihwo pamuorivhi unorimiwa, zvidotonyanyitsa kupusa peno kuti paphachikihwe mathai yagara yari yopakarepo.<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">vaIzirairi Vachaponesewa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Ndinodaba kuti hama dzangu musaye kuziva pamusoro pochidohwanda ichi, kuitira kuti mureke kuzvifurira muchiti mudochenjera: vaIzirairi vaita mwoyo udooma kwonguwa yakareino kusvikira uwandu hwovodzimwe Ndudzi hwakwana kupinda. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />Nokudaro vaIzirairi vese vachaponesewa. Semanyorehwo yazvidoitiwa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">“Mununuri achauya kubva paZioni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:26">achabiritsa kusaya umwari pana Jakobho.<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />Ichi ndicho chibvumirano chandichaita navo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:27">pakubisa kwandichaita zvitema zvavo.”<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Nondava yoNyaya Dzidonaka, parizvino imhandu kuna Mwari nokuda kwenyu imipa vodzimwe Ndudzi, asi panyama mbadikani nokuda kwomadziteteguru. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Ndava chipo chaMwari nokudaidza kwache zvinosandukaba. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Sezvamudondoitawo imipa kare manga musingateerere Mwari, asi manje mudotambira tsitsi dzamudotambira nondava yokusateerera kwavo. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />Saka naivo parizvino havasi kuteerera kuti naivowo vatambire tsitsi dzaMwari dzamudotambirawo imimi. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Ndava Mwari adozaririra vanhu vese pakusateerera kuti avaitire tsitsi vese.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwari Mbaakudziwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Nangarai makuriro youpfumi hwaMwari! nokugwiridza kwouchenjeri nomaziviro yache! Hapanai peno anobata matongero yache, nonzira dzache dzinonzvitsitsikaba peno!<verse eid="ROM 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />“Mbani adoziva pfungwa dzaIshe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:34">Nachipangamazano wakeyo, mbani?<verse eid="ROM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />Mbani ano chaadopasa Mwari</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:35">kuti Mwari amuripe?<verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Ndava zvinhu zvese zvidobva kwaari uye zviripo kuburikidza naye zvinouya kwaari ndava zvese nzvache. Kwaari mbakuve nokubhwinya nokusingapere. Ameni.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s1">Zvibairo Zvipenyu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Nokudaro nokuruvirai hama dzangu nomutsa waMwari kuti mupereke miviri yenyu sechibairo chipenyu, chitsvene, chinofadza Mwari kwakareko ndiko kunamata kwenyu kwopamweya. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Rekai kumbofanana nonyika ino, asi sanduhwai kuburikidza nokuvandudza mufungo wenyu, kuti mukwanise kuraidza nokuziva kuda kwaMwari kudonaka, kunofadza, kudokwana.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Nonyasha dzandidopasiwa, ndinoti kwamuri mese: Reka kumbozviona kunge wopamusoro kupinda zvauri, asi nopfungwa dzidopengenuka, uone zvinoenderana nochikero chokutenda kwaadopasiwa naMwari. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />Sezvatidondoita kuti tinomuviri mubodzi unonhengo dzidowanda, nhengo dzakaredzo dzese dzinoitaba basa ribodzi, <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />saka nesuwo muna Khirisitu nokuwanda kwedu daipo tiri muviri mubodzi, uye nhengo yega yega njodzimwe nhengo. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Tino zvipo zvidosiyana maererano nonyasha dzatidopasiwa. Kana chipo chomunhu chiri chokuporofita, mbaaporofite zvinoenderana nokutenda kwake. <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />Kana kuri kushanda, mbaashande, kana kuri kudzidzisa mbaadzidzise, <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />kana kuri kukurudzira, mbaakurudzire, kana kuri kubatsira vanosaya, mbaapereke achida, kana kuri kutungamirira, mbaatosimba, kana kuri kuitira tsitsi vamwe, mbaamboita adofara.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Rudo mbarive rudoperera. Zondai zvidoipa, mubatirire pano zvidonaka. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Sehama nohama, zvipei pakuitirana rudo. Remekedza abiyako kukunda kuzviremekedza kwaunoita. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Rekai kumboita makhato, asi pisai pamweya, itai shungu dzokushandira Ishe. <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Farai patariro, muite mwoyo murefu mumatambudziko, mutendeke paminyengetero. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Koveranai novanhu vaMwari vanosaya. Mbobatai mushe varendo.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Ropafadzai vanokutambudzai, ropafadzai rekai kuvashurikidza. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Vanofara, faraiwo navo, novanorira, riraiwo navo. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />Garai muchiwirirana. Rekai kuzvikudza, asi idai kufambidzana novanhu vadoderera. Rekai kuzviona kunge mudochenjera.<verse eid="ROM 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Rekai kumbodzotsera chidoipa nochidoipa. Tsvagai kuita zvidonaka pamberi povese. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Pazvinokwanisika pese, garai murunyararo nomunhu wese. <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />Rekai kutsiva vadikani, asi siirai nzvimbo ukari hwaMwari, ndava zvidonyohwa kuti, “Kutsiva mhwangu, ndicharipira,” ndizvo zvinoreva Ishe. <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Panzvimbo yokutsiva, “Kana muvengi wako wapfa nonzara, mupase chokuja, kana waanonyota, mupase chokumwa. Mukaita daro munovatsvonda nomoto wonyadzi.” <verse eid="ROM 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Rekai kumbokundiwa nozvidoipa, asi kundai zvidoipazvo nozvidonaka.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s1">Kuva Pasi poVanomasimba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Munhu wese mbaazviise pasi povatongi, ndava hapanai ukuru huripo husinai kumisiwa naMwari. Utongi huripo hudotogadziwa naMwari. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Saka uyo anopandukira vatongi anopandukira kugadza kwaMwari, manje vanhu vadodarovo vari kuzvisorera kutongewa. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Ndava vatongi vanochisaba kana uchiita zvidonaka, asi kuno avo vanoita zvidoipa. Unoda kugara usingache vatongi chere? Mboita zvidonaka kuti iye akuretserere. <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />Ndava iye muranda waMwari aripo kukunatsira. Asi kana uchidzonga, icha, ndava bakatwa raanaro anoritakuriraba mahara. Iye muranda waMwari, nhumwa youkari inoranga vanyangadzi. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Saka zvidokosha kuti uzviise pasi povanomasimba, aikona nondava yokucha kurangiwa basi, asiwo nokuda kwohana.<verse eid="ROM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Chakarechi ndicho chikonzero muchiripa mitero, ndava vanomasimba ava mbaranda vaMwari, vanopa nguwa yavo yese pakutonga. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Ripai munhu wese zvaanofanira kuripiwa. Kana iri mitero, ripai mitero, kana iri nzvimbo inoterehwa, itererei, kana vari vanokudziwa, vakudzei, kana vari vanyarikani, vanyarei.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuitirana Zvidokodzera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Rekai kuva nochikwerete nomunhu, kusiya kwochikwerete chinogara chiripo chokudanana, ndava anoda mabiyache anozazisa mutemo. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Mirairo inoti, “Reka kuita upombwe, reka kubaya, reka kuba, reka kuchiva,” Noumwe murairo, inozazisiwa pamutsara mubodziyu unoti, “Unofanira kuda muvakhidzani wako sekuda kwaunozviita.” <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Rudo runoitiraba umwe zvidoipa. Nokudaro rudo runozazisa mutemo.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Nokunzvitsitsa nguwa yatiri, pengenukai pahope muite zvakarezvo, ndava kuponesewa kwedu kwava papfupi panozvakwanga kuri patidotanga kutenda. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Usiku hwaakupera, zuva raakuda kubirika. Saka mbatisiyei zviito zvorima tisimire zvombo zvochiedza. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Mbatiraramei zvinomutsigo sevanhu vomasikati, mbatireke kuita zvomapira nokuredzera, kana chimeso meso nokuita madiro kana kuitirana mhoka, nochanje. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Asi simirai Ishe Jesu Khirisitu, murekere kufunga kufadza nyama pazvido zvayene.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s1">Reka Kutonga Vamwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Tambirai asinai kusimba pakutenda, musingapikisi mafungiro yache. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Kutenda kwoumwe kunomubvumira kuja zvese, asi anokutenda kusinai kusimba anondoja muriwo basi. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Anoja zvese mbaareke kuzvidza asingaje, noasingaje mbaareke kutonga anoja, ndava Mwari adomutambira. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />Anga iwepa ndiwe yani kuti utonge muranda womuridzi? kuna Ishe wache anomira kana kuwa. Achamira, ndava Ishe wache anogona kumumisa.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Umwe anoona rimwe zuva kunge ridokosha kukunda rimwe; asi umwe anoona mazuva yasinai chayadosiyana. Munhu wese mbaave nochokwadi chopfungwa dzache wega. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Anoona rimwe zuva kunge ridokosha kukunda yamwe, anozviitira Ishe. Anoja anojira Ishe ndava anopasa nhendo kuna Mwari, noasingaje anorekera Ishe achitenda Mwari nazvo. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Ndava hapanai wedu anozviraramira iye pachake, futi hapanai wedu anozvipfira iye pachake. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />Kana tichirarama, tinoraramira Ishe, kana tichipfa tinopfira Ishe. Saka kurarama kana kupfa tinenge tichindova vaIshe basi. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Nochikonzero chakarechi, Khirisitu adopfa ndokuva mupenyu kamu, kuitira kuti ave Ishe wovese vadopfa novapenyu. <verse eid="ROM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Anga manje iwepa unotongerei hama yako? Kana kuti unozvidzireiko hama yako? Ndava tese tichamira pamberi pochigaro chaMwari chokutonga. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Zvidonyohwa kuti: Ishe vanoti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">“Chokwadi, noupenyu hwangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">ibvi rese richandipfugamira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">nochirimi chese chichabvuma kuti ndini Mwari.”<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Saka umwe noumwe wedu achazvidairira wega kuna Mwari.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Reka Kupiya Vamwe Kuti Vawe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Nokudaro mbatirekei kutongana. Panzvimbo yokutongana, mbativei nopfungwa yokureka kuisira hama chigutsa munzira yache. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Inini semunhu ari muna Ishe Jesu ndino chokwadi kuti chokuja sezvachiri, hapanai chidosvipa. Asi kana munhu akachiti chidosvipa, kumunhu wakareyo ndiko kwachidosvipa. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Kana hama yako ichikanganisiwa nochaunoja, kureva kuti zvauri kuita hazvichinai rudo. Kuja kwako mbakureke kubaya hama yako idopfihwa naKhirisitu. <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Reka kutendera kuti chaunoti chidonaka, chidzotohwa sechidonyangara. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Ndava Umambo hwaMwari hakusi kuja nokumwa, asi nghururama, norunyararo nomufaro muMweya Mutsvene, <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />ndava wese anoshumira Khirisitu nonzira yakarei anofadza Mwari achiremekedzewa novanhu.<verse eid="ROM 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Saka nopatinogona napo mbatiedzei kuita zvinouyisa runyararo nokuvakhana. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Rekai kuparadza basa raMwari nondava yokuja. Zvokuja zvese zvidochena, asi zvidoipa kuti munhu aje chinhu chinokonzera umwe kuwa. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Hasa kutoreka kuja nyama kana kumwa waini kana kuita chipi zvachene chinokonzera hama kuwa. <verse eid="ROM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Saka chese chaunotenda panozvakarezvi mbachive pakati pako naMwari. Adokomborehwa munhu anohana isingamupase mhosva pachinhu chaanoti chidonaka. <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Kana munhu akaja achitsakidza, watova nomhosva, ndava kuja kwacheko kuri kubvaba pakutenda, ndava zvese zvisingabve pakutenda, chitema.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s1">Fadza Vamwe Aikona Kuzvifadza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Isisu vadosimba tinofanira kumboyamura vasinai simba pakutenda, tisingatsvage kuzvifadza. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Umwe noumwe wedu mbaafadze mabiyache nokuita zvidomunakira, kuti avakhike. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Ndava Khirisitu naiyewo pakamu haanai kuzvifadza iye, asi sekunyorewa kwazvidoitiwa, “Kutukirira kwaivo vadokutukanai kudowira pandiri.” <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Ndava zvese zvidonyohwa mumazuva yokare zvidonyorehwa kutiraira, kuitira kuti tipasiwe tariro inobva pakutsungirira nokukurudzira kwoMagwaro. <verse eid="ROM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Dai Mwari anopasa kutsungirira nokurudziro wakupasai mweya wokubatana pakati penyu pakutevera kwenyu Jesu Khirisitu <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />kuitira kuti nomwoyo mubodzi noizvi ribodzi murumbidze Mwari naBaba vaIshe wedu Jesu Khirisitu.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Vhangeri Kudzimwe Ndudzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Tambiranai, sekutambihwa kwamudoitiwa naKhirisitu kuitira kuti Mwari akudziwe. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Ndava ndinokunyepai kuti Khirisitu adova muranda wovadochecheudziwa adomirira chokwadi chaMwari, kuti asimbise chivimbiso chidopasiwa madzibaba yavo, <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />kuitira kuti dzimwe Ndudzi dzirumbidze Mwari nokuda kwotsitsi dzache, sekunyohwa kwazvidoitiwa:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">“Saka ndichakupupurai pakati podzimwe Ndudzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:9">ndichaimbira zita renyu zvimbo.”<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Pakamu zvinonzi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">“Farai novanhu vache imipa vodzimwe Ndudzi.”<verse eid="ROM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Pakamu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">“Rumbidzai Ishe, imipa mese vodzimwe Ndudzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:11">muimbe rumbidzo kwaari, imipa vanhu vese.”<verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Isaya anoti pakare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">“Mudzi waJese uchapukira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">iye achamuka kuti atonge Ndudzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">Ndudzi dzichagurupira maari.”<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Dai Mwari wotariro wakuzazai nomufaro wese norunyararo pakuvimba kwenyu naye, kuitira kuti kuburikidza nosimba raMweya Mutsvene kugurupira kupfachukire mamuri.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ushingi hwaPhauro paKunyora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Inipano pachangu hama dzangu, ndinogutsikana kuti imipa mudozara kunaka, mudozara kuziva kwese, futi munokona kudzidzisana. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Zviripo zvimwe zvandidoshinga kukunyorerai kuti ndizviyeuchidze kwamuri pakamu, nokuda kwonyasha dzandidopasiwa naMwari, <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />kuti ndive mushumiri waKhirisitu Jesu kuvanhu vodzimwe Ndudzi ndichiita basa rouphirisita hwovhangeri raMwari, kuti vodzimwe Ndudzi vave mupiro unotambirika kuna Mwari, udochenesewa naMweya Mutsvene. <verse eid="ROM 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Nokudaro ndinozvirumbidza muna Khirisitu Jesu, paushumiri hwangu kuna Mwari. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Ndinoshingaba kunyaira chimwe chinhu kusiya kwozvidoitiwa naKhirisitu kuburikidza nomandiri pakutungamira vodzimwe Ndudzi kuti yateerere Mwari kuburikidza nozvandidonyaira nozvandidoita, <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />nosimba rozviratidzo nominana, kuburikidza nosimba raMweya, zvokuti kubva muJerusarema kusvikira Iririkamu, ndidoparidza vhangeri raKhirisitu zvizere. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Shungu dzangu dzagara dziri dzokuparidza vhangeri munzvimbo dzisinai kumbozikana Khirisitu, kuti ndireke kuvakhira pamusoro ponheyo youmwe. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />Asi kuti semanyorehwo yazvene:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">“Vaye vasinai kunyepewa nozvake vachaona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:21">novaye vasinai kumbonzva vachanzvitsitsa.”<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Urongwa hwaPhauro Kubvakachira Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Chakarechi ndicho chikonzero chandaimbondotadzisihwa kuuya kwamuri. <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Zvino nzvimbo zvadzapera dzokuti ndishandire mumatunhu yakareya, uye sezvo ndagara ndichida kukuonai kwomakore mazinji, <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />ndino urongwa hwokuita izvozvo pakuenda kwangu kuSipeini. Ndinotarisira kukuonai pandinenge ndichipfuura nokwakareko kuti mundibatsire pahwendo hweko, mumasure mokufara nemi nguwa ipfupi. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Zvisinei, iye manje ndiri munzira kuenda kuJerusarema koshumira vatsvene ikoko. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Ndava vokuMasedhoniya novokuAkaya vadofarira kupereka ruyamuro kuvarombo vari pakati povatsvene vokuJerusarema. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />Vadofarira kuita zvakarezvo, futi vanotofanira kuvaitira daro. Ndava kana vodzimwe Ndudzi vadogovehwa makomborero yovaJudha yopamweya, ivo vanofanirawo kuvagovera makomborero yavo yopanyama. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Pandinopedza basa rakarero, uye ndaona kuti vatambira zvavadounganidzihwa zvacho, ndipo pandichakubvakachirai ndichienda kuSipeini, ndiri munzira yangu ipopa kuenda ikoko. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Ndinoziva kuti pandinouya kwamuri, ndinenge ndiri punumunu kuzara nomakomborero yaKhirisitu.<verse eid="ROM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Ndinokukumbiritsai, hama, kuburikidza nomuna Ishe Jesu Khirisitu uye nomurudo roMweya, kuti mukakate pabodzi nainini paminamato yenyu kuna Mwari pamusoro pangu, <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />kuti ndinunuhwe kuno vasingatende vokuJudhiya, uye kuti ushumiri hwangu muJerusarema hutambirike novatsvene vaikoko, <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />kuti nokuda kwaMwari ndiuye kwamuri nomufaro, uye kuti pakati penyu inini naimipa tivandudziwe. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Mwari worunyararo mbaave naimimi mese. Ameni<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s1">Kumoresana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Ndinoreverera hanzvadzi Febhi kwamuri, mushumiri wokherekhe iri kuKeningiriya, <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />kuti mumutambire muna Ishe sezvinokodzera vatsvene, mumubatsire panochidofanira kuti achiwane kwamuri, ndava iye adova mubatsiri wovazinji, kuverengera wakareni.<verse eid="ROM 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Moresai Pirisira naAkwira vashandi biyangu muna Khirisitu Jesu. <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />Vadoisa upenyu hwavo panjodzi nokuda kwangu. Aikona inini ndega, asiwo kherekhe dzese dzodzimwe Ndudzi dzinovatenda. <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Moresai kherekhe inokumana pamumba pavo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:5">Moresai Epenetasi shamwari yangu inodikana, ndiye adothanga kupinduka kuna Khirisitu mudunhu roEzhiya. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Moresai Mariya, adokushandirai zvidosimbitsa. <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Moresai Andironika naJuniasi, hama dzangu dzandanga ndinadzo mutorongo. Vanozikanitsa pakati ponhumwa, futi vadondithangira kuva muna Khirisitu.<verse eid="ROM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Moresai Ambiriyatasi, wandinoditsitsa muna Ishe. <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Moresai Yubhanasi, mushandi biyangu muna Khirisitu, naSitakisi shamwari yangu inodikana. <verse eid="ROM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Moresai Aperesi, adoedzewa ndokuoneka adokodzera muna Khirisitu. Moresai vomhuri yaArisitobhurasi. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Moresai Herodioni hama yangu. Voimba yaNasisasi vari muna Ishe, vamoresei.<verse eid="ROM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Moresai Turaifina naTuraifosa, vakadzi vakarevo vanoshanda zvidokungudza muna Ishe. Moresai Pesisi shamwari yangu inodikana, futi adoshanda zvidosimbitsazvo muna Ishe. <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Moresai Rafasi, adosarudziwa muna Ishe, naamai vache, vanga variwo amai kwandiri. <verse eid="ROM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Moresai Asinikiritasi, Feregoni, Hemesi, Patirobhasi, Hamasi nohama dzavanadzo. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Moresai Firorogasi, Juriya, Nariyasi nohanzvadzi yache naOrimupasi novatsvene vese vavanavo.<verse eid="ROM 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Moresanai nokutsvodana kutsvene. Kherekhe dzese dzaKhirisitu dziri kukumoresai.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuraira kwoKupedzisira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Ndiri kukukumbiritsai, hama, chenjererai vapesanisi vanouyisa zvigumbu, zvichipesana nodzidziso yamudodzidza, taramukanai navo. <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />Ndava vanhu vadodarovo vari kushumiraba Ishe wedu Khirisitu neye, asi kuda kuja. Vanotaura dzvene nokupenzveredza kuti vafurire vadopusa. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Nondava yokuti kuteerera kwenyu kudonzviwa novese, zvakarezvo zvidondizaza nokukufarirai, asi ndinoda kuti muchenjerere zvidonaka, muchiva madzemwa pazvinhu zvidonyangara. <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Zvino Mwari, worugare, achathachura Sathani nokamangu pasi potsoka dzenyu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:20">Mutsa dzaIshe wedu Jesu mbadzive naimimi.<verse eid="ROM 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Timoti mabiyangu pabasa, watumira kumoresa kwache kwamuri, ndomwenze kamu nohama dzangu Rusiyasi, Jasoni naSosipeta vaitawo zvibodzi bodzizvo.<verse eid="ROM 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Inipano Tatiyasi, nyakunyora gwaro rino, ndinokumoresai muna Ishe.<verse eid="ROM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Gayosi mwenekachiro wopamumba pandiri, ndipo kamu pamumba panokumana kherekhe, naiyewo ari kukumoresai, Eresitasi munyori woguta nohama yedu Kotasi, vari kukumoresai. <verse eid="ROM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />Mutsa waIshe wedu Jesu Khirisitu mbauve nemi mese. Ameni.<verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuvhara noMunamato woKurumbidza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />Kuna Iye anogona kukumisai semanyairiro yanoita vhangeri rangu nokuparidziwa kwaJesu Khirisitu, maererano nokubvuhunuriwa kwozvanga zvidobvinihiriwa kubva pakusikiwa kwonyika, <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />asi manje zvidobvuhunuriwa zvichibva zvazikana kuburikidza nozvinyohwa zvochiporofiti zvidozivisiwa kumarudzi yese, maererano nokuraira kwaMwari wokusingapere, kuitira kuti ndudzi dzese dzimutende nokumuteerera.<verse eid="ROM 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />Kuna Mwari wega adochenjera mbakuve kubhwinya narini narini kuburikidza naJesu Khirisitu. Ameni.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>